X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/the-art-of-visible-mending-honeycomb-darning/18482873/2026-04-07T10", "Press Democrat": "https://gathersebastopol.com/products/the-art-of-visible-mending-honeycomb-darning-tuesday-april-7"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/the-art-of-visible-mending-honeycomb-darning/18482873/2026-04-07T10"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:The Art of Visible Mending: Honeycomb Darning
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260407T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260407T123000
UID:260401BpPvyJTZI0CymYmAioxMhg
DESCRIPTION:The Art of Visible Mending: Honeycomb Darning\n\nHoneycomb dar
 ning is a structured\, decorative technique that reinforces knitwear while
  adding texture and pattern. In this hands-on workshop\, you’ll learn ho
 w to mend worn or thinning areas using a durable lattice-style stitch desi
 gned especially for knits.\n\nIn this workshop you’ll:\n\n• Learn the 
 fundamentals of honeycomb darning\n\n• Choose appropriate yarn and mater
 ials for knit repair\n\n• Create a structured mend on a practice swatch\
 n\n• Explore design choices to make your repair subtle or bold\n\nBring 
 a knit garment to mend or practice with provided materials. All supplies i
 ncluded.
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/the-art-of-visible-mend
 ing-honeycomb-darning/18482873/2026-04-07T10
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
