DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260407T173000
UID:260404qhR4tZb8AEKD1KZ3EVxs2g
DESCRIPTION:BLS Certification Class \\(AHA\\) - In Person\, Instructor-Led
 \n\nAmerican Heart Association BLS certification class \\(in-person\, inst
 ructor-led class in our Rohnert Park classroom\\). BLS \\(Basic Life Suppo
 rt\\) is the required CPR class for healthcare providers. Includes cardiac
  and respiratory arrest management\, CPR\, AED use\, and choking treatment
  for all ages. This class is appropriate for initial BLS or BLS renewal.\n
 \nVive CPR is an American Heart Association \\(AHA\\) Training Site. AHA "
 BLS Provider" certifications are issued on the same day.\n\nWe also offer 
 Blended Learning BLS certification courses \\(online course plus in-person
  Skills Session\\).\n\nLearn from a top-rated\, local CPR training company
  with over 900 5-star reviews! Our classes are fun\, engaging\, and expert
 ly taught by experienced first responders.\n\nLearn More & Enroll: https:/
 /vivecpr.com/class/bls-certification/\n\nQuestions? Call/text \\(707\\) 61
 2-3277 or https://vivecpr.com/contact
LOCATION:Vive CPR
URL:https://vivecpr.com/class/bls-certification
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/empanadas-workshop/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Empanadas: Sweet and Savory
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260407T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260407T200000
UID:260325DXc-OLnkXEaVvnp-bRWNbg
DESCRIPTION:Schedule\n\nTuesday\, April 7\, 2026 5:30 PM – 8:00 PM\n\nEx
 perience Level\n\nAll Levels\n\nEvent Categories: Bilingual\, Culinary Art
 s\n\nAge\\(s\\)\n\n18 and older\n\n$100 – Registration Cost\n\nMaster th
 e art of empanada making with both sweet and savory fillings. Learn dough 
 techniques\, folding methods\, and create delicious handheld pastries.\n\n
 What you’ll do\n\nDiscover the versatility of empanadas in this hands-on
  culinary class where you’ll master both sweet and savory variations of 
 this beloved pastry. Learn to create tender\, flaky dough from scratch and
  explore traditional filling techniques that balance flavor and texture. Y
 ou’ll prepare savory empanadas with options like seasoned beef\, chicken
 \, cheese and vegetables\, alongside sweet versions featuring fruit\, choc
 olate\, or dulce de leche. Instruction covers proper dough handling\, fold
 ing and crimping techniques for beautiful presentation\, and cooking metho
 ds including baking and frying. You’ll understand how to adjust moisture
  levels in fillings to prevent soggy pastries and learn tips for making em
 panadas ahead for easy entertaining. Whether you’re drawn to traditional
  Latin American recipes or creative fusion flavors\, this class gives you 
 the skills to make professional-quality empanadas at home. P
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/empanadas-workshop/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
