DESCRIPTION:Let your emotions flow into the canvas in this open art sessio
 n focused around wellness and stress relief. Whether you are doodling\, bl
 ending colors\, or painting your mood. This is space where you can unwind 
 and recharge. All materials provided\, come as you are and paint it out.  
