DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Supervisors approve the budget and oversee servi
 ces that shape daily life\, like housing\, public health\, wildfire prepar
 edness\, and transportation.\n\nThe 4th Supervisorial District includes ar
 eas of northern Santa Rosa\, the Larkfield-Wikiup-Mark West area\, Northea
 st Fulton\, the Town of Windsor\, the City of Healdsburg\, the community o
 f Geyserville\, and the City of Cloverdale. \n\nIf you live in one of the
 se areas\, this something you do not want to miss. Three candidates are ru
 nning to represent you: Melanie Bagby\, Todd Lands & Tom Schwedhelm. Fin
 d out which candidate is the one for you! Ask questions and hear from them
  directly!
