SUMMARY: Pilot Parallel Pen Demonstration: Beyond the Basics
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Juanita Watkins\nThursday\, April 9th\n4:30PM-5:3
 0PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Location\nFree!\n\nJoin local artist and callig
 rapher Juanita Watkins for this valuable demonstration that will introduc
 e participants to advanced techniques for creating art and lettering with
  Pilot Parallel Pens. She will discuss how to create multicolored letteri
 ng by touching pens. You will learn how to create shimmering gold ink eff
 ects using Finetec Gold and other Finetec colors\, and how to use a Paral
 lel Pen to ink a pointed dip pen to add fine lines and other effects. Oth
 er topics will include the unusual properties of various inks\, how to us
 e other inks than Pilot's\, how to completely dismantle and clean a Paral
 lel Pen\, and Cadel Lettering.\n\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Calligraphy
