 arn to craft realistic crepe paper flowers in this beginner workshop. Crea
 te vibrant poppies using petal-shaping techniques. All materials provided.
 \n\nAbout the Class\n\nCelebrate the arrival of springtime by learning how
  to create vibrant\, lifelike flowers using crepe paper in this beginner-f
 riendly workshop. We’ll explore techniques for shaping petals\, layering
  color\, and assembling blooms that look like real poppies! No prior exper
 ience is needed. Participants will leave with a small bouquet of finished 
 paper blossoms and the skills to continue making more at home. All materia
 ls provided.
