DESCRIPTION:Little hands make big magic in the garden! Kids will dig in th
 e dirt\, plant seasonal veggies and herbs\, and learn how plants grow from
  seed to sprout. Farmer Mikey keeps the class playful and exploratory - th
 e perfect introduction to gardening for young nature lovers. Adults can si
 p on bubbles while little ones explore the joys of gardening. Event Detail
 s: Includes: Picnic sack lunch for adult and child by Bricoleur Vineyards 
 Culinary team. Timing: 2.5 hour class \\*Please note this will require lon
 g periods of standing and walking on uneven and hard floors. Theme: Learn 
 the how-to&'s of garden planting Availability: Limited - 15 kids tickets a
 vailable\, 15 adult tickets available Club Members: Discount applies at ch
 eckout Dress Code: Casual\, closed-toe shoes Dietary Restrictions: We glad
 ly accommodate food allergies with advance notice so our guests can dine c
 omfortably and safely. We are unable to accommodate personal dietary prefe
 rences. Age Requirement: Family friendly class Pets: Not permitted at this
  event
LOCATION:Bricoleur Vineyards
