  around a primarily Latino audience and will be conducted in Spanish. Fami
 lies from underrepresented groups are welcome to join. Free transportation
  available within a 20 mile radius of the park for families in need. For q
 uestions\, please email senderos@sonomaecologycenter.org.\n\nThis event is
