DESCRIPTION:The Real Impostors began their musical journey over 35 years a
 go. Since then\, the band has thrived\, and throughout the years\, alumni 
 from many prominent Bay Area groups have passed through the ranks. In one 
 form or another\, this group has stayed together for decades as friends pl
 aying music they love! The present-day lineup includes former members of S
 tarship and Malo\, as well as current members of Cold Blood and Chris Cain
 . Together they create a fiery mélange of 60s-70s R&B\, Soul\, and Funk: 
 dynamic lead and background vocalists\, driving rhythm section\, and imagi
 native soloists\, they’ve……………………...\n\nFor more info: \
 \(pics\, videos\, etc.\\) www.therealimpostors.com Follow us on Facebook: 
 The Real Impostors\n\nFood: Delicious Dishez will be serving up Cajun Cuis
 ine: southern fried chicken\, fried fish\, shrimp\, fresh hand cut chicken
  tenders\, sticky icky wings\, gourmet Mac n cheese\, collard greens\, sea
