BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "http://sebastopolgallery.com"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:INTO THE LIGHT: Light-filled aintings by Katy Boggs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260414T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260414T170000
UID:260330R8EOqF5RkkmKv4TnXtM1cg
DESCRIPTION:Katy's paintings are an exploration of light—how it shapes f
 orm\, reveals color\, and defines what we see.\n\n"I am drawn to moments w
 here light is felt as much as seen: filtering through dense leaves\, tower
 ing in the crowns of trees\, glinting off cresting waves\, or softening in
 to the quiet glow of a sunset. Light is everywhere\; without it\, there is
  no seeing. Beyond its physical presence\, it also carries a deeper resona
 nce as a symbol of hope. In a time of uncertainty\, this work seeks to bri
 ng light into the image\, both visually and metaphorically."\n\nReception:
  April 25\, 4 to 6 pm.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Gallery
URL:http://sebastopolgallery.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/wildflower-preserve-hike-at-van-hoosear/18346437/2026-04-14T10", "Press Democrat": "https://sonomamountain.org/upcoming-hikes-on-sonoma-mountain/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/wildflower-preserve-hike-at-van-hoosear/18346437/2026-04-14T10"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Wildflower Preserve Hike at Van Hoosear
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260414T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260414T123000
UID:260324nSV3itMxME2d2lTF1evBuQ
DESCRIPTION:The Van Hoosear Wildflower Preserve is a 163-acre field on the
  lower slopes of Sonoma Mountain. Every year\, an extraordinary array of w
 ildflowers bursts forth in the fields with different species on display at
  different times of the spring. Thanks to the Goode family for sharing acc
 ess to the property and to SEC for co-managing it\, we will be leading one
  of the few hikes at the preserve this year. Don’t miss your chance and 
 join us to experience this fleeting spectacle. There is also a chance we w
 ill see song birds\, raptors\, coyotes\, and many butterflies.\n\nIt will 
 be a leisurely 2-mile hike with a brief uphill at the beginning. These hik
 es fill up fast\, so sign up early.
LOCATION:Van Hoosear Wildflower Preserve
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/wildflower-preserve-hik
 e-at-van-hoosear/18346437/2026-04-14T10
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
