 ted to explore the art of flamenco but haven’t had the chance\, now is y
 our opportunity! \\(Hard-soled shoes with low heels are recommended but no
 t required\\).\n\nWhat you’ll do\n\nJoin us for 6 weeks of introductory 
 flamenco dance classes led by Sophia de Leon Sanchez. This immersive exper
 ience in flamenco technique and choreography welcomes participants of all 
 ages and skill levels. If you’ve ever wanted to explore the art of flame
 nco but haven’t had the chance\, now is your opportunity! \\(Hard-soled 
 shoes with low heels are recommended but not required\\).
