SUMMARY:Kearsley Home Furnishings Moving Sale
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260417T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260417T173000
UID:260406msEtp65-YkalBIt4XSewIw
DESCRIPTION:Kearsley\, Sonoma’s renowned luxury linen and textile atelie
 r\, is relocating. In preparation\, the atelier has released its Kearsley 
 and Barbara Beckmann inventory at rare\, decisive pricing\, beginning at 5
 0% off.\n\nThe sale includes in-stock bed linens\, duvet covers\, coverlet
 s\, sheets\, pillowcases\, shams\, and outdoor pillows\, as well as fine f
 abrics by the yard for upholstery and drapery. Also available are hotel sa
 mple robes\, antique furniture\, a sleigh bed\, original artwork\, and rar
 e textile pieces seldom offered to the public.\n\nA broader selection is a
 vailable in-store\, including one-of-a-kind furnishings and collector-leve
 l pieces not listed online.\n\nKearsley is located through the Orchard Pla
 ce driveway entrance at Winery Sixteen 600\, and can also be accessed dire
 ctly from First Street West. The atelier is situated upstairs\, in the bac
 k of the beautiful yellow building.\n\nThis is a limited opportunity to ac
 quire exceptional design work from one of Sonoma’s most distinctive atel
 iers. Ideal for interior designers\, private clients\, collectors\, and th
 ose seeking truly special gifts.\n\nIn-store at 561 First Street West\, So
 noma\, and online at kearsleyhome.com April 1 through April 17\, while sel
 ections last.
LOCATION:Kearsley Sonoma Atelier
URL:https://kearsleyhome.com/collections/moving-sale
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/emergence-spring-through-the-eyes-of-the-artists/", "Press Democrat": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/emergence-spring-through-the-eyes-of-the-artists/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/emergence-spring-through-the-eyes-of-the-artists/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Emergence - Spring Through the Eyes of the Artists
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260417T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260417T160000
UID:260401TTlbhFSdC0SnCV1-gyz1Ig
DESCRIPTION:"Emergence" brings together the Artists of Fulton Crossing to 
 explore what Spring means to their creative lives. Spring is more than a s
 eason. It's a metaphor. It's renewal\, risk\, color\, thawing\, blooming\,
  awakening\, and sometimes even struggles. The public is invited to enjoy 
 this free Art exhibit and to take time to wander through the artists studi
 os and gallery spaces. Meet the artists at our opening reception March 21s
 t. Upcoming Art Workshops: March 21: Painting Easter Cookies. April 18: Ci
 gar Box Collage. May 16: Succulent Garden Centerpiece. Make treasures to b
 ring home. All ages welcome. Materials provided. E-mail Brenda at nanaspre
 ttypaper@outlook.com for preregistration and workshop info.
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/emergence-spring-through-the-eyes-of-
 the-artists/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
