 ild Start are proud to announce the reopening of the former Beverly Hills 
 Elementary School as the Rise Vallejo Early Learning Center. This center r
 epresents a shared vision to expand access to high-quality early learning\
 , family support\, and community connections in Vallejo—now and for gene
 rations to come. This 18-classroom facility will provide over 200\\+ child
 care and preschool slots annually.
