DESCRIPTION:Get ready to rewind the clock and test your 90s music knowledg
 e at Priest Ranch! Join us on Friday\, April 17th for a fun-filled night o
 f Music Bingo featuring all your favorite hits from the decade of boy band
 s\, grunge\, and pop anthems. Sing along\, mark your bingo cards\, and com
 pete for prizes while sipping your favorite Priest Ranch wines. Feeling no
 stalgic? Come dressed in your best 90s-inspired outfit for a chance to win
  our Best Throwback Look prize. Your $10 ticket acts as a deposit toward w
 ine purchases during the event. Food from The Kitchen at Priest Ranch will
  be available for purchase to keep you fueled while you play. Gather your 
 friends\, brush up on your 90s hits\, and get ready for a night of music\,
  wine\, and a little friendly competition.\n\nSpots are limited—secure y
 our ticket now and get ready to sip\, sing\, and shout BINGO!
