 eating al fresco is your idea of fine dining\, then this should be on your
  culinary bucket list. This one-of-a-kind experience is inspired by the fl
 avors of the Mediterranean. Each pop-up event brings our team of chefs\, e
 ach showcasing our interpretation of Medi-American cuisine cooked over a l
