UID:2603126mS399plhUGzifn15if3rg
DESCRIPTION:Petaluma’s long-time favorite Grateful Dead tribute band\, D
 ead Again\, reunites for a special evening of music to help raise funds ne
 eded to preserve and restore the rose window in the historic 1901 Brainerd
  Jones-designed church at 5th and B.\n\nDead Again is cooking up something
  very special\, from the band that celebrated roses so often in their song
 s. We plan to highlight the album named for a rose\, and several other son
 gs featuring flowers \\(especially roses\\)\, fire\, and friends. There wi
 ll be a silent auction with rare and wonderful Grateful Dead and stained-g
 lass related items.\n\nThe Band: David Dodd \\(keys\\)\, Harold Hampton \\
 (drums\\)\, Dave Knorr \\(bass\\)\, Jenna Mammina \\(vocals\\)\, John Ruch
  \\(guitar\\)\, John Sassano \\(guitar\\)\n\nFeaturing the Larking About c
 hoir of UU Petaluma\, and other special guests
LOCATION:Unitarian Universalists of Petaluma
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/744799624891619/
