DESCRIPTION:Join us as we unveil our newly remodeled Windsor store with an
  epic Spring Block Party! We’ve refreshed every corner to serve you bett
 er\, and we’re celebrating with a massive community bash featuring live 
 vendor demos from industry favorites like Weber\, Stihl\, Milwaukee\, and 
 more\, plus food samples\, giveaways\, and prizes. To thank our community\
 , we are picking up the tab on sales tax for the entire day. You’ll also
  find exclusive\, event-only offers storewide\, including free BBQ supplie
 s and potting soil with qualifying purchases\, and a free engraved pet tag
  with any $50\\+ pet department spend. Come explore the new space\, meet y
 our neighbors\, and join us for a day of festivities designed just for you
 .
LOCATION:Garrett Hardware Windsor Store
