X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/the-art-of-visible-mending-woven-darning/18483067/2026-04-18T10", "Press Democrat": "https://gathersebastopol.com/products/the-art-of-visible-mending-woven-darning-saturday-april-18"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/the-art-of-visible-mending-woven-darning/18483067/2026-04-18T10"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:The Art of Visible Mending: Woven Darning
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260418T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260418T123000
UID:260401MKP2nyEtMEqMkBQE8qcBwg
DESCRIPTION:The Art of Visible Mending: Woven Darning\n\nLearn how to repa
 ir clothing with woven darning—a functional and beautiful technique espe
 cially suited for knitwear. This workshop covers material selection\, sett
 ing up a darn\, and weaving strong\, expressive patches.\n\nIn this worksh
 op you’ll:\n\n• Choose yarns and materials for woven darning\n\n• Se
 t up and weave a stable darn\n\n• Explore design choices for creative\, 
 visible repairs\n\nBring a garment to mend\, or use provided samples.Mater
 ials included\; no experience required.
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/the-art-of-visible-mend
 ing-woven-darning/18483067/2026-04-18T10
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
