SUMMARY:Painting Watercolor Flowers: Beginners 4
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260418T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260418T150000
UID:260406IIE_qr2GakCIU6LSbfqIOQ
DESCRIPTION:4-Week Flowers Course \n\nLearn basic techniques\, color mixin
 g\, brush strokes & have fun exploring the beauty of watercolors. \n\nThis
  is for beginners & all those who have ever wanted to try the magic of wat
 ercolor paint.\n\nWe'll practice basic watercolor techniques\, wet-on-wet 
 technique\, glazing & layering\, as we delve into the beauty & magic of pa
 inting nature.\n\nDiscover a step-by-step process for creating expressive 
 watercolor FLOWERS as we explore light and texture to capture your subje
 ct.\n\nFee: $160\, must bring own supplies.\n\nDrop-in rate $50 \\(if clas
 s space allows\\)
LOCATION:Full Circle Studio
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/painting-watercolor-flo
 wers-beginners-4/18503605/2026-04-18T13
