DESCRIPTION:Coombsville Vintners and Growers are excited to announce our S
 eventh Annual Discover Coombsville Grand Tasting Event.   More than 25 e
 steemed producers will be on hand pouring Coombsville diverse range of win
 es. Indulge in an unforgettable wine experience and join fellow wine enthu
 siasts for an elegant event featuring limited-production wines\, acclaimed
  vintners\, gourmet pairings.\n\nWhether you’re a seasoned collector or 
 simply love exceptional wine\, this is a rare opportunity to taste\, conne
 ct\, and celebrate in true Napa Valley style. Mingle with Napa Valley indu
 stry pioneers. Please join us in tasting a diverse range of wines\, includ
 ing Cabernet Sauvignon\, Rosé\, Sauvignon Blanc\, Merlot\, and more\, all
  harvested from Coombsville's distinct terroir.
