DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260418T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260418T160000
UID:260302V4QOk-qoZUKIQ8S3ePLffw
DESCRIPTION:April 18\, 2026 – 1:30 PM & 5 PM Seatings\n\nTickets on Sale
  March 12\, 2026. Members receive 48 hour pre-sale access. Become a member
  here.\n\nThe Trashion Fashion Sonoma fundraiser returns to the Sonoma Vet
 erans Memorial Hall for two shows on Saturday\, April 18th\, at 1:30 PM an
 d 5:00 PM. In its 16th year\, the beloved Trashion Fashion Runway Show wil
 l feature over forty designers who make wearable art from recycled and unc
 onventional materials. Designers and models\, from adults\, teens\, and tw
 eens\, will be strutting down a 60-foot runway and igniting the curiosity 
 and hearts of the audience! Costa’s Tacos truck will have food available
  for purchase\, and beverages will be available on the patio. The 5 p.m. s
 eating includes a closing reception with delicious bites by Isa Jacoby. Se
 ating is determined during event registration.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/events/trashion-fashion/#runway
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
