DESCRIPTION:The 5th Annual Novato Spectrum Safety Event focuses on connect
 ing our adaptive needs community to our Novato First Responders and other 
 valuable resources in our City and County to continue to build strong rela
 tionships within our community. The event will feature out of this world a
 ctivities geared specifically for participants with adaptive needs provide
 d by local partner agencies who directly support the adaptive needs commun
 ity. RSVP to this FREE \\#NovatoFUN event at  www.novato.gov/regforfun sta
 rting Tuesday\, February 10.
LOCATION:Pocket Park 950 Seventh Street Novato
