X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_c_rilc5rtgatnr4oln08fo9p5k30
SUMMARY:Treats and Trivia ~ Docent and Member Party!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260418T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260418T213000
DTSTAMP:20260407T031337Z
UID:1ieuvng5rmcpvjcmsdtis6nusc@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260418T193000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260112T175813Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Put your space knowledge to the test in an evening of astro
 nomy-themed fun! From celestial phenomena to rockets\, satellites\, and ic
 onic sci-fi\, our three-round trivia game will challenge beginners and sea
 soned stargazers alike. Prizes will be awarded for 1st\, 2nd\, and 3rd pla
 ce\, and even if you don’t take home a win\, you’ll still enjoy an ass
 ortment of sweet treats and astronomical delights throughout the night.</p
 ><p>After trivia concludes\, we’ll open our three telescopes for a guide
 d observing session under the night sky.</p><p>Trivia teams may include up
  to five participants\, and we encourage mixing groups to meet new people.
  Plus\, our volunteers tend to be very useful when astronomy questions ari
 se.<br> </p><p>While this event is free to members and docents and their 
 families\, please sign up at <a href="http://rfo.simpletix.com" target="_
 blank"><u>rfo.simpletix.com</u></a> using your member code so we know how
  many people to expect. Thank you!</p><p>Not a member? You can sign up for
  membership here: <a href="https://rfo.org/index.php/membership/" target=
 "_blank"><u>https://rfo.org/index.php/membership/</u></a><br></p><p>If the
 re are additional questions\, please email info@rfo.org. Thank you\, and w
 e look forward to seeing you at future events. </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260112T181026Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Robert Ferguson Observatory
X-SOURCE-URL:https://rfo.org/index.php/calendar-of-events/
END:VEVENT
