UID:260403nCjQSqRo3E6rFnKePPL-EQ
DESCRIPTION:Rayven Justice live in Downtown Santa Rosa! Tap In Saturdays a
 t Barrel Proof Lounge. April 18\, 9pm. $15/$20. 21+\n\nRayven Justice Live
  in Downtown Santa Rosa – Tap In Saturdays at Barrel Proof Lounge\n\nBay
  Area R&B and hip-hop star Rayven Justice brings his smooth vocals and hig
 h-energy performance to Downtown Santa Rosa for one night only.\n\nKnown f
 or hits like “Slide Thru” and collaborations across the West Coast sce
 ne\, Rayven Justice blends R&B melodies with hip-hop edge\, creating a liv
 e show that hits both the heart and the dance floor.\n\nThis is part of Ta
 p In Saturdays \, a late-night party series at Barrel Proof Lounge featuri
 ng live performances\, DJs\, and packed dance floors.\n\nExpect a high-ene
 rgy crowd\, club vibes\, and a night that builds from doors to close.\n\nS
 aturday\, April 18 Doors: 9PM 📍 Barrel Proof Lounge — 501 Mendocino A
