SUMMARY:Tea Dance & Mixer & Fundraiser for SoCoDykeMarch
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260419T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260419T190000
UID:26031922t14_Goy0mYjF6lhOzqig
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to mix\, mingle\, and dance with an amazing queer cr
 owd for a very worthy cause.\n\nWhether you're here to dance\, mingle\, or
  just enjoy some good vibes\, this is the place to be. Cocktails\, wine an
 d beer available. Snacks from Spinster Sisters.\n\nTonight's event include
 s Sapphic Stories from 5-6pm. Cheryl King hosts the salon - where SoCoDyke
 March producers Nancy Kelly and Pam Adinoff will join local historian Tina
  Dungan\, Sonoma Pride's Grace Villafuerte and singer/songwriter Erica Amb
 rin\, for stories\, music\, interviews and a panel.\n\nDance music provide
 d by local vibe curator\, DJ Dyops.\n\nTickets $15. For more info on the S
 oCoDykeMarch\, visit https://www.socodykemarch.org
LOCATION:The Astro Motel
URL:https://www.tickpick.com/organizer/event/tea-dance-mixer-91210270
