DESCRIPTION:<br><br><span>Come join us for a potluck evening\, where Joel 
 Berger will lead a Seder\, for DSA Members and allies in the telling of th
 e Jewish Passover story.  The event is a fun and lively one\, no need to l
 earn a different language\, the book we all read from was made by Joel's f
 amily over many many years and is in English and phonetic Hebrew for all. 
  Food and drink will be provided\, to stay Kosher for Passover\, as is tra
 dition\, if you would like to offer a dish for the potluck\, we will be ha
 ving all dishes with 'unleavened bread' products. Please reach out to Coch
 air2@socodsa.org for any questions about the seder or potluck items you wo
 uld like to contribute. We hope to see you there!</span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260320T165651Z
