 e your body\, and boost your mood instantly.\n\nCome dance\, sweat\, smile
 \, and find your rhythm! Leave the studio feeling lighter\, brighter\, and
  completely energized to take on your day.\n\nBook your spot and make ‘G
 ood Morning’ truly mean ‘Good Day’!\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway
  \\#8 San Rafael\, CA\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor marking 
 shoe soles allowed.
