DESCRIPTION:Schedule\n\nTuesday\, April 21\, 2026 5:30 PM – 7:30 PM\n\nL
 ocation\n\nRoom 201\, Fiber Arts Studio\n\nExperience Level\n\nBeginning\n
 \nEvent Category: Fiber Arts\n\nAge\\(s\\)\n\n13\\+\n\nRegistration Cost:\
 n\n$45\n\nMaterials Fee:\n\n$5\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$50\n\nLearn
  essential embroidery techniques and create a stitch sampler. All supplies
  included\; take home your hoop\, needle\, thread\, and skills.\n\nAbout t
 he Class\n\nLearn all the essential techniques of embroidery and create yo
 ur very own stitch sampler project. This class covers all the basics in em
 broidery. Learn how to select fabrics\, set up your hoop\, transfer patter
 ns and master fundamental stitches \\(running\, backstitch\, satin and Fre
 nch knot\\). All supplies and patterns will be provided. You will have you
 r own project\, hoop\, needle\, and some thread to take home to continue y
 our embroidery journey. Plus all the skills to start another project!
