 otal Registration Cost:\n\n$75\n\nRegister\n\nSew comfy unisex lounge pant
 s: learn patterns\, measuring\, cutting\, elastic waistbands\, and durable
  seams—ideal for advanced beginners.\n\nAbout the Class\n\nMake your own
  comfortable\, unisex lounge pants in this class for advanced beginner sew
