DESCRIPTION:Step into a higher class of cannabis. **Elevated Sessions** is
  an intimate\, sommelier-led tasting experience featuring **CAM** premium 
 indoor flower and curated for the true cannabis connoisseur.\n\nJoin us fo
 r a refined **60 minute** session designed to awaken the senses. Your cann
 abis sommelier will guide you through **4 exceptional cultivars** — expl
 oring their terpene profiles\, aromas\, flavors\, and effects — while yo
 u savor a drink from the natural soda bar\, curated snacks\, and palate cl
 eansers.\n\nThis is more than a tasting — it’s an immersive journey th
 rough craft cannabis\, where every detail is designed to elevate your even
 ing\, from the intimate atmosphere to the exclusive perks awaiting guests.
 \n\n**Date & Sessions**\n\n**Date:** Friday\, April 24\, 2026\n\n**Two Ses
 sions:** 6:00 PM & 8:00 PM\n\n**Capacity:** 16 guests per session (32 tick
 ets total)\n\n**What’s Included**\n\n**Enjoy a refreshing Natural Soda**
  – A cannabis-infused palate opener\n\n**Guided Tasting of 4 Curated Str
 ains** –Guests enjoy exclusive cultivar drop\n\n**Tasting Passport** –
  Track aromas\, effects\, and personal favorites\n\n**Charcuterie & Palate
  Cleansers** – Light bites designed for the session\n\n**Meet The Grower
 ** – Learn how this award-winning flower was grown\n\n**Exclusive Perks*
 * – Discounts + access to limited drops\n\n**Ticket Tiers (Limited to 16
  Guests per Session)**\n\n**6:00 PM Tasting - $75:** Includes 🌱 $50 Goo
 die Bag\, 4 Curated Tastings\, Tasting Passport\, Natural Soda Bar\, Snack
 s & Exclusive Deals\n\n**8:00 PM Tasting - $75:** Includes 🌱 $50 Goodie
  Bag\, 4 Curated Tastings\, Tasting Passport\, Natural Soda Bar\, Snacks &
  Exclusive Deals\n\n21+ Only | DCC # C12-0000420-LIC
