 e providers and preschool teachers\\) and meets state / EMSA requirements 
 for CPR First Aid training for CA childcare providers. American Heart Asso
 ciation "Heartsaver Pediatric First Aid CPR AED" certifications are issued
  on the same day.\n\nVive CPR is a top-rated\, local CPR training company 
 with over 900 5-star reviews! Our classes are fun\, engaging\, and expertl
 y taught by experienced first responders.\n\nLearn More & Enroll: https://
 vivecpr.com/class/pediatric-cpr-first-aid-certification/\n\nContact Us: \\
 (707\\) 612-3277 or https://vivecpr.com/contact
LOCATION:Vive CPR
URL:https://vivecpr.com/class/pediatric-cpr-first-aid-certification
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
