DESCRIPTION:Invite Friends to join you aboard River Dolphin. Join Dolphin 
 Charters and Myrna Hayes\, river guide for a morning boat trip on the Napa
  river.\n\nDolphin Charters' Barbara Fitzgerald and River Guide Myrna Haye
 s\, will share an "outstanding river adventure"\, featuring National Park 
 Service sailing ships up close along Mare Island docks\, nesting osprey\, 
 natural\, cultural and naval history on the Napa River/ Mare Island Strait
  and restored wetlands to the north. $50 each. For RESERVATIONS Call 510-5
 27-9622\n\nCall Dolphin Charters 510-527-9622 to reserve.
LOCATION:Vallejo Marina
URL:https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1402570601911449&set=a.5559013499
 11716
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "http://sebastopolgallery.com"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:INTO THE LIGHT: Light-filled aintings by Katy Boggs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260425T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260425T170000
UID:260330F33k3h-3r0iGVW6FzFOoPw
DESCRIPTION:Katy's paintings are an exploration of light—how it shapes f
 orm\, reveals color\, and defines what we see.\n\n"I am drawn to moments w
 here light is felt as much as seen: filtering through dense leaves\, tower
 ing in the crowns of trees\, glinting off cresting waves\, or softening in
 to the quiet glow of a sunset. Light is everywhere\; without it\, there is
  no seeing. Beyond its physical presence\, it also carries a deeper resona
 nce as a symbol of hope. In a time of uncertainty\, this work seeks to bri
 ng light into the image\, both visually and metaphorically."\n\nReception:
  April 25\, 4 to 6 pm.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Gallery
URL:http://sebastopolgallery.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
