UID:260218y1e0CnmXcEmQaICVtTQl7w
DESCRIPTION:Building Brain-Healthy Habits: An education program presented 
 by the Alzheimer's Association \n\n \n\nTIPS TO BUILD HEALTHY HABITS AND \
 n\nHELP PROTECT YOUR BRAIN \n\nResearch shows there are everyday habits yo
 u \n\ncan build today to help protect your memory and \n\nthinking as you 
 get older - even reducing your \n\nrisk of cognitive decline and possibly 
 dementia. \n\nJoin us to learn about: \n\n» Healthy habits for your brain
 \, like \n\nexercising and eating right. \n\n» The brain-heart connection
 . \n\n» Why brain health is important at all ages. \n\n» Building your p
 ersonalized action plan for \n\nbrain-healthy habits. \n\n \n\nVisit alz.o
 rg/CRF to explore additional \n\neducation programs in your area. https://
 www.lakecountyca.gov/calendar.aspx?EID=14252
LOCATION:Lakeport Library
URL:https://www.lakecountyca.gov/calendar.aspx?CID=24&showPastEvents=false
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
