BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.thehelixschool.org/p2p5k"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.thehelixschool.org/p2p5k"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Paths to Possibility 5K Run\, Walk\, Roll – Supporting Autistic 
 Learners
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T120000
UID:260219rNzUDMYRCkeAqWjHfLVc_g
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a community celebration of movement\, inclusion\, 
 and possibility.\n\n​The Paths to Possibility 5K is a family-friendly co
 mmunity event open to participants of all ages and abilities. Whether you 
 run\, walk\, or roll\, this inclusive celebration brings together students
 \, families\, educators\, local businesses and non-profits  for a morning
  of movement\, connection\, and shared purpose. All proceeds benefit the H
 elix School’s programs for neurodivergent youth from age 5 to 22.\n\n**W
 hat to Expect**:\n\n\\- Scenic 5K and fully accessible 1M routes\n\n\\- Mu
 sic\, raffle prizes\, speakers\, race awards\n\n​- Food and beverage tru
 cks\n\n\\- Activities for kids\, and a sensory room\n\n\\- Vendors with di
 verse services and products\n\n\\- Participants receive a Paths to Possibi
 lity t-shirt and bib with registration\n\n**When:**\n\nSunday\, April 26\,
  2026 – 8 am to 12 pm\n\nOnsite registration opens at 8 am\n\nParticipan
 ts will begin at 9 am\n\n**Where:**\n\nMarin Civic Center Lagoon Park\n\n1
 60 Armory Dr.\n\nSan Rafael\, CA 94903\n\nYour participation supports The 
 Helix School’s mission of guiding autistic children to lead fulfilling a
 nd connected lives. Funds raised help expand programs\, services\, assisti
 ve technologies\, and ensure that every student has access to what they ne
 ed to thrive.\n\nTo register\, volunteer\, or donate\, please visit: https
 ://www.thehelixschool.org/p2p5k
LOCATION:Marin Civic Center Lagoon Park
URL:https://www.thehelixschool.org/p2p5k 
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://petalumadowntown.com/antique-show", "Press Democrat": "https://petalumadowntown.com/antique-show"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://petalumadowntown.com/antique-show"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:The Petaluma Spring Antique Faire
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T160000
UID:260212TLjJkh40ME2ZAvOJCuKRLw
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a day of shopping and collecting in beautiful Down
 town Petaluma!\n\nAntique and collectible lovers throughout the Bay Area a
 re welcome to come\, browse and shop the 41st Annual Petaluma Antique Fair
 e this Spring on Sunday\, April 26\, 8 am to 4 pm set in one delightful an
 d relaxing setting of Downtown Petaluma.  Admission is free.\n\nThe Faire
  will be located on Kentucky Street\, Fourth Street\, in the A Street park
 ing lot\, and on Western Avenue.\n\n"The Bay Area's Premier Antique Center
 \," Historic Downtown Petaluma will transform into an antique marketplace.
  Amid the beautiful historic buildings\, one-of-a-kind stores\, an incredi
 ble array of restaurants and cafes\, guests can find an incomparable selec
 tion of affordable antiques from over 200 dealers. The show has a nice var
 iety of estate jewelry\, linens\, furniture\, art\, kitchenware\, vintage 
 décor\, books\, and all kinds of unusual collectibles to suit everyone's 
 budget.\n\nThis show attracts over 8\,000 discerning collectors as well as
  first-time buyers wishing to collect and invest in real antiques.\n\nVisi
 t PetalumaDowntown.com for more information!
LOCATION:Historic Downtown Petaluma
URL:https://petalumadowntown.com/antique-show
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
