DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T120000
UID:260122SXnPX4jVSUq5GmGG1Dt6xA
DESCRIPTION:Join us every month for a group ride from Sports Basement!\n\n
 We meet on the last Sunday of the month at 9am inside the store and start 
 the ride at 9:15am.\n\nMost routes are 30-40 miles and all rides are no-dr
 op\, meaning we won’t leave any rider behind. \n\nRegular updates can b
 e found on our Strava Page (search for: Sports Basement Santa Rosa Rides)\
 n\nFeel free to call the store with any questions at 707-921-3151.\n\nHope
  to see you there!
LOCATION:Sports Basement
URL:https://www.strava.com/clubs/santarosagrouprides
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sports Basement": "https://www.strava.com/clubs/552156/group_events/3412607180149289862"}
X-SOURCE-ID:sportsbasement
SUMMARY:SANTA ROSA RIDE GROUP
DTSTART:20260426T090000
DTEND:20260426T110000
UID:f3a2c656c836d299@sportsbasement.com
DESCRIPTION:Join bike department staffers Cullen and J-Wo for a gorgeous r
 ide through wine country to do some leaf peepin’ as the vineyards change
  color! We are upgrading our normal ride to a more intermittent route\, lo
 nger in distance and a bit more elevation\, including the classic Vine Hil
 l climb. Meet at the store at 9am and be ready to roll out by 9:15am. I he
 ard a rumor there might even be apple cider donuts afterwards… Bring a f
 riend and hope to see you there! *No drop *Helmets required *Need a bike? 
 We rent ‘em! All riders are required to sign our waiver prior to joining
  the ride.
LOCATION:SB Santa Rosa
URL:https://www.strava.com/clubs/552156/group_events/3412607180149289862
X-SOURCE:Sports Basement
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/sup-yoga-on-the-petaluma-river/18069218/2026-04-26T09"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:SUP Yoga on the Petaluma River
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T110000
UID:260317RwBlOpx3ZUiyrr64-fLcTQ
DESCRIPTION:Slow down and float into a quieter rhythm with SUP Yoga on the
  Petaluma River at The Floathouse Petaluma. Launching from downtown Petalu
 ma\, this peaceful on-the-water yoga experience feels worlds away from the
  bustle—set in the calm\, protected turning basin where the river natura
 lly invites you to relax.\n\nThis all-levels\, 90-minute session welcomes 
 everyone\, from first-time paddle boarders and yoga newcomers to experienc
 ed practitioners. We begin with a short\, gentle paddle from the docks to 
 get comfortable on your board \\(knees are always welcome\\)\, then anchor
  together so tidal movement won’t interrupt your flow. Once settled\, yo
 u’re free to move\, stretch\, rest\, or simply be—guided by expert ins
 truction and supported by the shared energy of the group. Evening sessions
  and morning sessions allow YOU to choose the vibe that suits you best.\n\
 nAll equipment is provided\, including extra-stable paddleboards that are 
 wider and longer than a yoga mat\, designed to help you feel grounded and 
 secure on the water.\n\nPerfect for locals and Bay Area visitors alike\, S
 UP Yoga on the Petaluma River offers a rare chance to experience downtown 
 Petaluma from the water—peaceful\, playful\, and deeply restorative.\n\n
 It’s YOUR river. Come out and play.
LOCATION:The Floathouse Petaluma
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/sup-yoga-on-the-petalum
 a-river/18069218/2026-04-26T09
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
