DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T120000
UID:260403LCcma8jdHUiu18NoUrm8KA
DESCRIPTION:Above and beyond the pom. Join us in the Marietta Tasting Room
  with the incredibly creative Naomi\, who will teach you the basics of pom
  pom making using a variety of yarns in a spectacular range of colors. Lea
 rn to make pom poms of any size to adorn your keychain\, rearview mirror\,
  or Christmas tree (and beyond!). Swim in a sea of colored yarn and create
  your own magical orb.  All materials are provided\, and no prior experie
 nce is necessary. Family-friendly event.\n\nLight snacks are provided\, a
 nd the first glass of wine is included.
LOCATION:Marietta Cellar's Tasting Room
URL:https://www.fielddayca.com/event-details/pom-workshop-at-marietta-cell
 ars-2026-04-26-10-00
