DESCRIPTION:**Our Community\, Our Family**\n\n**Celebrating Together**\n\n
 As a family and a wider community\, we share our strongest bonds when we b
 reak bread together. That is made all the sweeter when we can also contrib
 ute to the greater good in the world through this simple act. Come eat\, c
 elebrate and listen to the best musical artists in our region\, and perhap
 s\, the world\, with all your generous neighbors as we make good for other
 s who need our help. Contribute to our cause because SONOMA CARES! Visit o
 ur website for more information and a link to our tickets. Get yours soon 
 before they are gone!
