DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260427T203000
UID:260319TXmECDjwl0mxPSDv-s0Q2w
DESCRIPTION:Start Your Day with Joyful Movement: Morning Jazz Dance!\n\nRe
 volutionize your routine and ignite your spirit with our Morning Jazz Dan
 ce class! This is more than just a dance class—it’s a vibrant\, energ
 etic start designed to flood your body with feel-good endorphins and set a
  positive\, unstoppable tone for the hours ahead.\n\nEnjoy a Fun\, Energiz
 ing Warm-up: Wake up your muscles and mind with a dynamic warm-up that ge
 ts your blood pumping and prepares your body for movement.\n\nBuild Founda
 tion with Technique: We’ll introduce simple\, accessible jazz technique
  and exercises focused on strengthening your core and improving flexibi
 lity and coordination.\n\nLearn Feel-Good Choreography: Dive into short\,
  simple\, and joyful dance combinations designed to make you smile\, mov
 e your body\, and boost your mood instantly.\n\nCome dance\, sweat\, smile
 \, and find your rhythm! Leave the studio feeling lighter\, brighter\, and
  completely energized to take on your day.\n\nBook your spot and make ‘G
 ood Morning’ truly mean ‘Good Day’!\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway
  \\#8 San Rafael\, CA\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor marking 
 shoe soles allowed.
LOCATION:4140 Redwood Highway #8
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/sexy-jazz-dance/1762442
 8/2026-04-27T19
