BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://bit.ly/ScamsAISeminar"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:AI\, Scams and Elder Abuse Awareness
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260428T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260428T140000
UID:260407AownDp6Pl0a4FJBK6gXZ4g
DESCRIPTION:The speakers for this talk will be Dan Ryan with Redwood Credi
 t Union\, an AI expert\, Crista Barnett with Senior Advocacy Services Nort
 h Bay\, and Amanda Esposti\, the Windsor Police Dept Community Services Of
 ficer. Using examples\, they will give you tips on how to recognize AI gen
 erated material\, scams\, and elder abuse\, plus provide tips on what to d
 o to protect yourself. Amanda will wrap up the talk to let you know what W
 indsor Police Dept has seen lately in our area. A car safety hammer is inc
 luded\, while supplies last\, one per family. The talk is free for all to 
 attend\, so please share this invite.\n\nTo register go to https://bit.ly/
 ScamsAISeminar or call the Senior Center at 707-838-1260. Pre-registration
  is not required but is recommended for the Car Safety Hammer giveaway. Fo
 r those of you who don’t drive\, there will be an alternative giveaway. 
 This presentation is part of the Windsor Ready Talk series hosted by the T
 own of Windsor and Windsor COPE. For more information email windsor\\_cope
 @yahoo.com.
LOCATION:Windsor Recreation Senior Center
URL:https://bit.ly/ScamsAISeminar
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/family-search-center/16618066/2026-04-28T13"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Family Search Center
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260428T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260428T160000
UID:2604067iST6IvxRUuWkJmf5MC4JA
DESCRIPTION:Discover your family story at our Family Search Center You wil
 l find our center in the Lakeport building in the room next to the nursery
 . Local volunteers can help jumpstart your family history journey. Our cen
 ter is staffed on Tuesdays from 1pm - 4pm\, reach us in person or by phone
  \\(707\\) 280-9545 during those hours. All services provided in centers a
 re free. You’ll enjoy: Personalized help Center guests can receive perso
 nal help from volunteers in one of more than 5\,400 centers worldwide. Acc
 ess to technology Centers offer complimentary access to computers\, intern
 et\, and subscription family history websites. Available resources vary by
  location. Access to exclusive records Visitors to FamilySearch Centers ge
 t special access to images of historical records that are only available i
 n centers. Websites available at all locations: Ancestry\, My Heritage\, F
 amily Search\, Find My Past\, American Ancestors\, Geneanet https://www.fa
 mily search.org Explore videos about family history and temples at collect
 ion/temple-and-family-history-messages-from-leaders?lang=eng
LOCATION:The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/family-search-center/16
 618066/2026-04-28T13
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
