DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260429T180000
UID:2603300xCxL7xpRk67RlaF4615MQ
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate 18 years of community at Vallejo Yoga and the grand 
 opening of Cyndi’s Sound Bath Studio. This relaxed\, come-and-go open ho
 use invites you to explore the space\, enjoy light bites\, and experience 
 live sound demonstrations with crystal bowls\, chimes\, and gong.\n\nConne
 ct with the community\, enter to win raffle prizes from local partners\, a
