X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Stitch Together
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260429T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260429T190000
UID:260124FLH6gFqgIUuHmc20FP2ziw
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Stitch Café\, a cozy open studio held twice a mon
 th. Whether you're working on your own project or eager to explore new men
 ding techniques like darning and appliqué\, this is the perfect space to 
 gather\, share ideas\, and sew together. We provide hand-sewing supplies a
 nd materials\, but feel free to bring your own - it's all about community\
 , creativity\, and enjoying the process.By repairing what we already have 
 and re-using materials\, we're not just preserving memories and adding uni
 que touches to our belongings - we’re also reducing waste and contributi
 ng to a more sustainable lifestyle. We can extend the life of our clothes 
 and fabrics\, and take small but meaningful steps toward caring for the pl
 anet.
LOCATION:Art Escape
URL:https://artescapesonoma.jumbula.com/Spring2026/StitchTogether429
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
