X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Tockify Rileystreet.Art.Com": "https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/465/1778952600000"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tockify_rileystreet.art.com
X-SOURCE:Riley Street Art Supply
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.rileystreet.com/pages/santa-rosa-classes-events
UID:TKF/640bd014795edf4fa3769b14/465/29649210/0/0
DTSTART:20260516T173000Z
DTEND:20260516T223000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/465/1778952600000
SUMMARY: Drawing Spring Flowers with Colored Pencil
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Victoria A. Kochergin\n\nMay 16th\, 2026\n\n10:30
 AM - 3:30PM\n\nLocation: Santa Rosa\n\nFee: $95.00\n\nSpring is here as f
 lowers continue to bloom all around us! What better time to learn how to 
 draw spring flowers with colored pencil. Join this workshop as we delve i
 nto drawing spring flowers using colored pencil as a medium. The morning 
 portion of this workshop will focus on colored pencil principles and tech
 niques\, student exercises and creating color palettes. The afternoon wil
 l be dedicated to hands-on drawing time with individual one-on-one assist
 ance. All levels welcomed. Ability to draw freehand is not needed to part
 icipate in this workshop. Materials list to be emailed once registration 
 is completed.\n\nTo register\, please contact Victoria at mailto:kochergi
 @sonic.net kochergi@sonic.net mailto:kochergi@sonic.net mailto:kochergi@s
 onic.net or (707) 479-3336.\n\nVictoria A. Kochergin is a local botanical
  artist and instructor who works with colored pencil and acrylics. Her ar
 twork has been exhibited in galleries\, wineries\, botanical gardens\, in
 ternational shows and on Alcatraz. For more information about Victoria\, 
 please visit her website at www.victoriakochergin.com http://www.victoria
 kochergin.com/
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Colored-Pencil,Botanical
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/640bcf85795edf
 4fa3769ae5/641f771c1421bf7aabc6f2cc/scaled_384.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Instructor: Victoria A. Kochergin May 16th\, 2026 10
 :30AM - 3:30PM Location: Santa Rosa Fee: $95.00 Spring is here as flowers
  continue to bloom all around us!...
LOCATION:Rileystreet Art Supply\,103 Maxwell Ct\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401\,
  USA
CREATED:20260210T010354Z
DTSTAMP:20260406T003214Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260210T010354Z
