SUMMARY: Ongoing Gel Printing & Collage Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Magdalena Bogart\nMonday\, May 18th\n1:00PM-4:00P
 M\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n$45.00\n\nIn my monthly gel-printing & Col
 lage workshop I want to offer\nyou the opportunity to collage with your h
 andmade papers\nstarting with an easy project progressing each month to a
  more\nchallenging one.\n\nI will demonstrate techniques for making paper
 s with\nand without the Gel-Plate. We will create a collection of cohesiv
 e\npapers. The best of them you will use for your collage project of the 
 month.\n\nSome examples could be fish\, a butterfly\, a vase with flowers
 \,\na grouping of various cups and more.\n\nStarting with the project in 
 February a requirement is that you\nare familiar and comfortable cutting 
 shapes with an X-acto knife\nor a similar tool.\n\nTo register for this w
 orkshop\, please contact Magdalena at: 408.781.2589 or by email\nat: mail
 to:mag.bogart@gmail.com mailto:mag.bogart@gmail.com mailto:mag.bogart@gma
 il.com mailto:mag.bogart@gmail.com mailto:mag.bogart@gmail.com mag.bogart
 @gmail.com mailto:mag.bogart@gmail.com
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,gel-printing
