SUMMARY: Fresh Pressed Flower Card Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Jan Lochner\nSaturday\, May 23rd\n2:00PM-5:00PM\n
 Santa Rosa Location\n$35.00\n\nThis is a hands on make and take class whe
 re you will make at least five items including a bookmark\, a greeting ca
 rd\, a fridge magnet and an ornament. The class will use two different te
 chniques and Jan will explain how to press flowers and which flowers hold
  their color best. It is a creative experience!\n\n\nTo register for this
  workshop\, please contact Jan at: freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com mail
 to:freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com mailto:freshpressedflowercards@yahoo
 .com\n\nCreating note cards from pressed flowers has been Jan’s hobby for
  25 years\, though she has no formal art training. She utilizes color\,\n
 shape and texture on fine quality paper\, each card uniquely handmade. Ja
 n’s home in Sebastopol is her studio: the dining room table is her worksh
 op\, the kitchen cupboards storing boxes and trays of flowers. She buy ca
 rd stock by the thousand and pick blooms from her garden and other public
  places. Her family is used to me saying\, “could we stop for just a few 
 minutes so I can gather some… ”\n\nIt is a wonderful way of life.\n\n*A n
 ote to all students: Please park on in the East facing parking lot while 
 attending classes. We greatly appreciate it. Thank you.
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa
