DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260606
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260607
DTSTAMP:20260406T211332
CREATED:20251201T012428Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260122T030721Z
UID:10000298-1780704000-1780790399@ranchonicasio.com
SUMMARY:THE HOT LICKS- celebrating the music of Dan Hicks
DESCRIPTION:DINNER SHOW with THE HOT LICKS- celebrating the music of Dan Hicks\nThe Hot Licks\, original members of Dan’s backing band\, perform Dan’s classic songs in the style that Dan Hicks invented – Folk/Swing! – A blend of Gypsy Jazz\, Folk and Swing with lots of vocal harmonies. The Hot Licks are dedicated to preserving the original sound and spirit in the way Dan taught them! They carry the torch for Folk-Swing with his signature style that has inspired so many others. “The group’s hallmark country/jazz styled vocals shined\, highlighted by delectable guitar and violin solos.\nThe spirit and the sound of that previous Incarnation with Dan Hicks and his spirit is imbued in their sound. A rare occasion not to be missed!” – Arne Frager\, The Plant Studios
URL:https://ranchonicasio.com/event/the-hot-licks-celebrating-the-music-of-dan-hicks-2/
LOCATION:Rancho Nicasio\, 1 Old Rancheria Rd\, Nicasio\, CA\, 94946\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ranchonicasio.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/570146-1.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Jack London State Historic Park": "https://jacklondonpark.com/events/iphone-photography-2026"}
X-SOURCE-ID:jack_london_park
SUMMARY:A Creative Photography Workshop
DTSTART:20260606T090000
DTEND:20260606T150000
UID:06a9801d32d6e198b21e384429e17204@jacklondonpark.com
DESCRIPTION:The camera you always carry with you—your iPhone camera! Mom
 ents\, memories\, and vistas –photographed with confidence and ease. For
  the first half we will discuss\, and demonstrate:The settings\, filters\,
  exposure\, focus\, shutter speeds\, panoramas\, macro\, close ups\, portr
 aits.  Throughout the workshop\, we emphasize the creative and artistic 
 side of photography. Then we will move outdoors to put into practical use 
 the things we have just talked about and have the chance for a quick lunch
  in the park
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park\, 2400 London Ranch Road\, Glen E
 llen\, CA 95442
URL:https://jacklondonpark.com/events/iphone-photography-2026
X-SOURCE:Jack London State Historic Park
END:VEVENT
